{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome in this unique puzzle-casual game of Tanks Boom Boom. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set aside! The Mega-Tank is coming, destroying everything in front of him. Our advice is to join the tank cabin,using all it\u2019s skills like : speed booster,time warp,money booster,otherwise you risk being eaten alive. Convince yourself right now that either you win or you are bound to lose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to pass every level shooting the cubes so that mathematically it comes out at 0. Fire in the hole !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features :</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 60 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A series of bonus levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use the special skills of the tank : speed booster, reload speed, money booster</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2086990?t=1767086607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2086990?t=1767086607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086990/18d08c7be345b707e274789fbc6822185918453c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767086607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086990/18d08c7be345b707e274789fbc6822185918453c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767086607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome in this unique puzzle-casual game of Tanks Boom Boom. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set aside! The Mega-Tank is coming, destroying everything in front of him. Our advice is to join the ta